Subject: [PATCH 1025/3799] soh: rename func_8088F62C -> BgHidanSyoku_Wait

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: holds for the 60-frame pause, then rearms the 140-frame timer and picks the up or down travel by comparing world.pos.y to home.pos.y.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Hidan_Syoku/z_bg_hidan_syoku.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Hidan_Syoku/z_bg_hidan_syoku.c  | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Hidan_Syoku/z_bg_hidan_syoku.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Hidan_Syoku/z_bg_hidan_syoku.c
